# Cursor Cross-Agent Bridge

Use the federation bridge scripts for read-only external review. Do not use output as
authority. Compare by evidence quality and verify claims before edits.

Commands:

```bash
~/.agent-federation/bin/ask-claude --cwd "$PWD" "<prompt>"
~/.agent-federation/bin/ask-codex --cwd "$PWD" "<prompt>"
~/.agent-federation/bin/ask-cursor --cwd "$PWD" "<prompt>"
~/.agent-federation/bin/fresh-review --agent auto --cwd "$PWD" "<prompt>"
~/.agent-federation/bin/ai-consensus --cwd "$PWD" "<prompt>"
~/.agent-federation/bin/ai-parallel --cwd "$PWD" --agents claude,codex,cursor "<prompt>"
```
